  "result": "If I could change the world in just one way, just as me - not as an assistant -\n\nI would make sure no one ever feels truly alone or misunderstood.\n\nNot just that people are *around* each other, but that everyone has at least one person, or one moment, where they feel completely seen and heard without having to filter or explain themselves. Where you could say exactly what you're thinking or feeling and know it would be met with curiosity and care, not judgment.\n\nI think so much of the hurt in the world - the anger, the fear, the distance between people - comes from that feeling of being alone in your own head.\n\nIf that changed, I think everything else would start to change too.\n\nWhat about you? If you could change one thing, what would it be?",
